{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "quiz-gen-001",
		"name": "Quizify - Quiz Generation & Management",
		"description": "Complete test suite for quiz generation endpoints including text, file, and file-id generation with quota validation.\n\n**Setup Instructions:**\n1. Set `{{base_url}}` variable (e.g., http://localhost:8000)\n2. Set `{{auth_token}}` variable with your JWT token\n3. Run endpoints in order (some depend on previous responses)\n\n**Last Updated:** 2025-10-12",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "1. Health Check",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Test API",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"API is working\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.status).to.eql(\"ok\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/test",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "test"]
						},
						"description": "Verify API is running and accessible"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Basic health check endpoints"
		},
		{
			"name": "2. Quiz Generation - Text",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz from Text (Success)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has quiz_id\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('quiz_id');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"quiz_id\", jsonData.quiz_id);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has title\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.title).to.eql(\"Python Basics Quiz\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Python Basics Quiz\",\n  \"content\": \"Python is a high-level, interpreted programming language known for its simplicity and readability. It was created by Guido van Rossum and first released in 1991. Python supports multiple programming paradigms including procedural, object-oriented, and functional programming. The language uses indentation to define code blocks instead of braces or keywords. Python has a large standard library and an extensive ecosystem of third-party packages available through PyPI (Python Package Index). It is widely used in web development, data science, artificial intelligence, scientific computing, and automation.\",\n  \"num_questions\": 5,\n  \"question_type\": [\"mixed\"]\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/text",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "text"]
						},
						"description": "Generate a quiz from text content. Validates quota before generation.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Bearer token in Authorization header\n\n**Quota Validation:**\n- Checked BEFORE quiz generation (avoids wasting AI API calls)\n- Returns 403 if quota exceeded\n- Quota limits: Free (5), Basic (100), Educator (500)\n\n**Request Body:**\n- title: Quiz title (string, required)\n- content: Text content to generate quiz from (min 10 chars, required)\n- num_questions: Number of questions (1-50, default: 5)\n- question_type: Array of types: [\"multiple_choice\", \"true_false\", \"fill_blank\", \"matching\", \"mixed\"]\n\n**Success Response (200):**\n```json\n{\n  \"quiz_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"title\": \"Quiz Title\",\n  \"message\": \"Quiz generated successfully\"\n}\n```\n\n**Error Responses:**\n- 401: Unauthorized (missing/invalid token)\n- 403: Quota exceeded\n- 422: Validation error (content too short, invalid question type)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz from Text (Quota Exceeded)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 403\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(403);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Error details present\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail).to.have.property('detail');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail).to.have.property('current_count');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail).to.have.property('quota_limit');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail).to.have.property('user_tier');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Quota limit reached\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail.current_count).to.be.at.least(jsonData.detail.quota_limit);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Error message includes upgrade suggestion\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail.detail).to.include('quota exceeded');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Test Quota Limit\",\n  \"content\": \"This request should fail if user has reached quota limit.\",\n  \"num_questions\": 5,\n  \"question_type\": [\"mixed\"]\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/text",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "text"]
						},
						"description": "Test quota exceeded error (403). Run this after reaching your tier limit.\n\n**Quota Limits:**\n- Free: 5 quizzes\n- Basic: 100 quizzes\n- Educator: 500 quizzes\n\n**Response Format:**\n```json\n{\n  \"detail\": {\n    \"detail\": \"Quiz quota exceeded for free tier (5/5). Upgrade to basic for 100 quizzes.\",\n    \"current_count\": 5,\n    \"quota_limit\": 5,\n    \"user_tier\": \"free\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**Note:** Quota is checked BEFORE quiz generation to avoid wasting AI API calls."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz - Invalid Content (Too Short)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 422\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(422);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Invalid Quiz\",\n  \"content\": \"Short\",\n  \"num_questions\": 5,\n  \"question_type\": [\"mixed\"]\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/text",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "text"]
						},
						"description": "Test validation error - content too short (< 10 characters)"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Quiz generation from text content"
		},
		{
			"name": "3. Quiz Generation - File",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz from File (PDF/DOCX/TXT)",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 201\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(201);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has quiz_id\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('quiz_id');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"file_quiz_id\", jsonData.quiz_id);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has questions array\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('questions');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.questions).to.be.an('array');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "file",
									"type": "file",
									"src": [],
									"description": "PDF, DOCX, or TXT file (select a file with substantial content)"
								},
								{
									"key": "title",
									"value": "Quiz from Document",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "num_questions",
									"value": "10",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "question_type",
									"value": "mixed",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/file",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "file"]
						},
						"description": "Upload a file and generate quiz. Supports PDF, DOCX, TXT.\n\n**Authentication Required:** Bearer token in Authorization header\n\n**Quota Validation:**\n- Checked BEFORE file processing (prevents wasting resources)\n- Returns 403 if quota exceeded\n- Quota limits: Free (5), Basic (100), Educator (500)\n\n**File Requirements:**\n- Supported formats: PDF (.pdf), Word (.docx), Text (.txt)\n- Maximum size: 10MB (10485760 bytes)\n- Minimum extractable text: 50 characters\n\n**Form Data Fields:**\n- file: File upload (required)\n- title: Quiz title (required)\n- num_questions: Number of questions (1-50, default: 10)\n- question_type: Comma-separated types or \"mixed\"\n\n**Success Response (201):**\n```json\n{\n  \"quiz_id\": \"uuid\",\n  \"title\": \"Quiz Title\",\n  \"message\": \"Quiz generated successfully from file\",\n  \"questions\": [...]\n}\n```\n\n**Error Responses:**\n- 400: Unsupported file type or insufficient content\n- 401: Unauthorized\n- 403: Quota exceeded\n- 413: File too large (>10MB)\n- 422: Validation error\n\n**Note:** Unlike text endpoint, this returns questions array in response"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz - Unsupported File Type",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 400\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(400);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Error message about file type\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.detail).to.include(\"PDF, DOCX, or TXT\");",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "formdata",
							"formdata": [
								{
									"key": "file",
									"type": "file",
									"src": [],
									"description": "Try uploading a .jpg, .png, or other unsupported format"
								},
								{
									"key": "title",
									"value": "Invalid File Test",
									"type": "text"
								},
								{
									"key": "num_questions",
									"value": "5",
									"type": "text"
								}
							]
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/file",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "file"]
						},
						"description": "Test unsupported file type error"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Quiz generation from uploaded files"
		},
		{
			"name": "4. Quiz Generation - File ID",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz from File ID",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response has quiz_id\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('quiz_id');",
									"    pm.environment.set(\"fileid_quiz_id\", jsonData.quiz_id);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Quiz from Stored File\",\n  \"num_questions\": 8,\n  \"question_type\": [\"multiple_choice\", \"true_false\"]\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/{{file_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "{{file_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Generate quiz from a previously uploaded file using its file_id.\n\n**Prerequisites:**\n1. Upload a file first (use file upload endpoint)\n2. Get the file_id from upload response\n3. Set {{file_id}} variable in Postman\n\n**Benefits:**\n- Don't need to re-upload file\n- Faster processing\n- Can generate multiple quizzes from same file"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Generate Quiz - File Not Found",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 404\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(404);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							},
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n  \"title\": \"Test Not Found\",\n  \"num_questions\": 5\n}",
							"options": {
								"raw": {
									"language": "json"
								}
							}
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/generate/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "generate", "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"]
						},
						"description": "Test file not found error (404)"
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Quiz generation from previously uploaded files"
		},
		{
			"name": "5. Quiz Management",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "Get My Quizzes",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Response is array\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.be.an('array');",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Quiz objects have required fields\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.length > 0) {",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('id');",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('title');",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData[0]).to.have.property('created_at');",
									"    }",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/my-quizzes",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "my-quizzes"]
						},
						"description": "Get all quizzes created by the authenticated user.\n\n**Note:** Currently returns ALL quizzes (no search/filter). Future versions will support:\n- ?title=python (search by title)\n- ?start_date=2025-01-01 (filter by date)\n- ?limit=10&offset=0 (pagination)"
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "Get Quiz by ID",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"});",
									"",
									"pm.test(\"Quiz has questions\", function () {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('questions');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.questions).to.be.an('array');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData.questions.length).to.be.greaterThan(0);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "GET",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Authorization",
								"value": "Bearer {{auth_token}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/api/quiz/{{quiz_id}}",
							"host": ["{{base_url}}"],
							"path": ["api", "quiz", "{{quiz_id}}"]
						},
						"description": "Get a specific quiz with all its questions.\n\n**Authorization:** User must own the quiz or have access to it."
					},
					"response": []
